{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Enter a world where ancient echoes tell captivating tales imbued with a resonating symphony of...you get the gist.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong> I know what you're thinking, &quot;Another <i>love letter</i>\u00a0 to <i>golden era</i> JRPG's. Full of <i>nostalgia</i> and <i>lighthearted </i>adventures with a lovable cast. A celebration of <i>timeless classics</i> like Final Fantasy and Dragon Quest\u2026a\u00a0 passion project years in the making. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Yeah, yeah, yeah, it's already been done before!\u201d\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>So why should you care about <i>ToEotSoM</i> (working title)?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Because it\u2019s <i>none</i>\u00a0 of those things.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It just wants to make you laugh. It\u2019ll even settle for a sharp exhale through the nose.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>It\u2019s not celebrating anything or writing any letters. It's not the second coming of Chrono Trigger nor will it make you feel something you last felt in 1999. This game is just a light roast by someone who grew up on JRPG\u2019s and and now wants to make something that is basically one big inside joke. So come with me and\u00a0 let\u2019s go find some girl\u2019s missing cat by morning then discover the world is ending\u00a0 by dusk.\u00a0</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_at_2.57.41_PM_4.png?t=1744213839\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/extras/Screenshot_2025-04-06_at_2.57.41_PM_9.png?t=1744213839\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.s